#. World Health Organization: Organización Mundial de la Salud (OMS).
msgid "WHO"
msgstr "OMS"

#. Pan American Health Organization: Organización Panamericana de la Salud.
msgid "PAHO"
msgstr "OPS"

#. Global Digital Health Certification Network. WHO's Spanish name (circular
#. letter C.L.38.2023) is "Red Mundial de Certificación Digital de Salud";
#. WHO's Spanish texts then write "la Red Mundial", so here the acronym is
#. often rendered by that short form rather than carried verbatim.
#, localised
msgid "GDHCN"
msgstr ""

#. Community health worker: "agente comunitario de salud" (OPS usage).
#, localised
msgid "CHW"
msgstr ""

